{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 290, "line_no": 24, "text": "“•••⋯贫不可为贼，贱只宜卖气。倘忽行乱偷，通寨一力禁革。上下邻村多有被盗苦", "bbox_px": {"x": 181, "y": 1694, "w": 1467, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "“•••⋯贫不可为贼，贱只宜卖气。倘忽行乱偷，通寨一力禁革。上下邻村多有被盗苦", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 181, "y": 1694, "w": 1467, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 290, "line_no": 25, "text": "案，只因强盗告失主之事。今我寨上，若有非及行强盗告失主者，大众必同力面差吊", "bbox_px": {"x": 105, "y": 1754, "w": 1548, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "案，只因强盗告失主之事。今我寨上，若有非及行强盗告失主者，大众必同力面差吊", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 105, "y": 1754, "w": 1548, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 290, "line_no": 26, "text": "打，支用银钱不能相丢。倘有白日夜晚，拿得是贼是盗者，众人一力上前砍手剜目，使成", "bbox_px": {"x": 105, "y": 1819, "w": 1548, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "打，支用银钱不能相丢。倘有白日夜晚，拿得是贼是盗者，众人一力上前砍手剜目，使成", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 105, "y": 1819, "w": 1548, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 290, "line_no": 27, "text": "废人。…”", "bbox_px": {"x": 109, "y": 1883, "w": 225, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.3, "blocks": [{"text": "废人。…”", "conf": 0.3, "bbox_px": {"x": 109, "y": 1883, "w": 225, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
